bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 0, "CSS 2.2 appendix E paints in-flow block backgrounds (step 4) before floats (step 5). Simple paints in tree order, so a block that follows a float in the source and overlaps it covers the float. Chrome 159, block top CSS y 50: float rows 200..279 at k=4 (50..69 at k=1); Simple 240..279 (60..69)."
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 1, "Same class: a 10.75px right float beside a clear:left block that starts at 10.25px loses its last rows (Chrome 1600..1642 at k=4, Simple 1600..1640); that row is left unpinned in float_fractional_height_clear_chrome159_spec."

